.TH TIMES 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
times \- reads process and child cpu times in clock ticks; the return value is elapsed ticks from an arbitrary origin
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/times.h>
.B clock_t times(struct tms* buffer);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads process and child CPU times in clock ticks; the return value is elapsed ticks from an arbitrary origin.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result on success, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR times (2)
